            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Trust is a concept discussed in the literature of many disciplines, but the definitions used are varied. In this paper, the author explores the use of trust in various disciplines to create a definition suitable for nursing science using Watson's theoretical perspective.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
